WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.320 --> 00:00:05.350
GONEN STEIN: There is a large
multinational security company.

00:00:05.350 --> 00:00:08.200
And their challenge was
to migrate their existing

00:00:08.200 --> 00:00:10.340
workloads from their
on-premise infrastructure

00:00:10.340 --> 00:00:12.440
in multiple
geographical locations

00:00:12.440 --> 00:00:13.920
into Google Cloud Platform.

00:00:13.920 --> 00:00:17.140
Their challenge was that their
applications were very complex.

00:00:17.140 --> 00:00:18.690
What they've done
with CloudEndure

00:00:18.690 --> 00:00:22.260
is they were able to remove the
complexity entirely and convert

00:00:22.260 --> 00:00:25.330
the systems into a Google
platform very, very simply.

00:00:25.330 --> 00:00:28.230
A very lightweight
version of those systems

00:00:28.230 --> 00:00:31.260
is being maintained in
Google Cloud Platform.

00:00:31.260 --> 00:00:34.090
And it's only being spun up
when they actually need it.

00:00:34.090 --> 00:00:35.640
And diverse customers
will continue

00:00:35.640 --> 00:00:37.476
to use the cloud more and more.

00:00:37.476 --> 00:00:38.850
And the cost
reduction that we've

00:00:38.850 --> 00:00:43.100
seen among many of our customers
has been upwards of 90%

